body:
Quick pass: good. Head `933e177` merges cleanly with `main`. On this head:
- the quick gate is green (394 steps, 0 failed);
- clippy of `camcraft-app` and `camcraft-ui` is clean;
- the light lane is green (4 steps, 0 failed).

The `crates/ui` test count goes from 2019 to 2022. An independent pre-review found no blocking points. A bad holder file is refused by name and applies nothing, including an outline with a negative radius or fewer than 3 points. The MCP import refuses when the user library cannot be read. I flag the PR ready for review.

@sn3ro, a UI/UX review from you is welcome on this PR (the Holders page Import… and Export…). A contributor's pre-check comment is fine. We take your findings into the PR or into a follow-up issue.
